      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "17 Kennan Walk represents the a wonderful opportunity to secure a stunning end-terrace, three-bedroom home in the Woodbrook style at Luttrellstown Gate.\r\n\r\nThis house comes with designated parking and a wonderful west facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nLuttrellstown Gate is a brand-new development of 3 and 4 bedroom homes delivered by the award winning Castlethorn, widely regarded for their exceptional quality and workmanship.\r\n\r\nThis delightful, A rated home, briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC, a generous reception room featuring a corner window and ample storage, and a bright, open-plan kitchen, living and dining area with utility room and double door access to the garden. Upstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms, including a beautifully appointed en-suite master bedroom, along with a stylish family bathroom.\r\n\r\nLuttrellstown Gate is situated adjacent to Luttrellstown Castle Estate and just minutes from Dublin' s Phoenix Park. The development is immersed in natural amenities in this idyllic setting, without compromising on access to Dublin 15' s extensive and varied facilities. From the picturesque Phoenix Park and Strawberry Beds to the various GAA, Rugby, Soccer and Golf Clubs nearby, Dublin 15 has something for everyone.\r\n\r\nWith excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre and beyond just moments from the development, Luttrellstown Gate is the perfect location for those looking to stay connected to the city without the hustle and bustle of an urban setting. With easy access to the M50 and situated just a short stroll from Coolmine train station and Dublin Bus services, Luttrellstown Gate offers residents convenient connectivity across Dublin and further afield.\r\n\r\nDublin 15 benefits from an excellent variety of retail and restaurants, from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre just a few minutes away to the Wren' s Nest and Goats Gruff nestled in the nearby Strawberry Beds. For families, Dublin 15 offers an array of options for both primary and secondary schools right on your doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* Brand-new end-of-terrace home\r\n* Approx. 102 sq.m / 1,097 sq.ft\r\n* Firebird air source heat pump with 24/7 programmable heating controls\r\n* Designated parking space \r\n* Spacious master bedroom with en-suite \r\n* Attic stairs providing additional storage \r\n* Contemporary, high-quality specification throughout\r\n* Side entrance to west-facing rear garden"
